      "excerpts": [
        "With both sequence clustering and random MSA sampling, AF2 predicted an incorrect hybrid α-helix/β-sheet CTD conformation (Supplementary Figure 1c,d). Nevertheless, these results suggested that better predictions may be achieved by randomly sampling MSAs with depths other than 10 or 100, the only two depths randomly sampled in the Paper.\nDOI: 10.1038/s41592-022-01488-1 PMID: 35637307 PMCID: PMC9184281\n7. Del Alamo D., Sala D., McHaourab H. S. & Meiler J. Sampling alternative conformational states of transporters and receptors with AlphaFold2. Elife 11, doi: (2022). DOI: 10.7554/eLife.75751 PMID: 35238773 PMCID: PMC9023059\n8. Dishman A. F. & Volkman B. F."
